    /* #211 wave 2: keeled over, slumped, went limp, stopped answering, not sure he is breathing, no pulse found, se desplomo, no vuelve en si */
    /* #212 (r34) unconscious: no pulse in Spanish, chest compressions, not moving or breathing, not come round */
